            "description": {
              "content": "Get all message threads that you have created, filtered by time interval and/or specific message thread IDs. Note this operation uses [Pagination](https://mews-systems.gitbook.io/connector-api/guidelines/pagination/) and supports [Portfolio Access Tokens](https://mews-systems.gitbook.io/connector-api/concepts/multi-property).",
